# Deployment archives.
#
# These are built to be uploaded to the host, not to be tracked. backend.zip in
# particular packs backend/.env, so committing one would publish the database and
# mail credentials in a repository that is public.
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz

# Anything that looks like an environment file, wherever it appears. The backend
# has its own rule for this; this one catches copies made outside it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
